name: Context experiment evidence stays distinct, completely readable and source-bound
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_result_evidence.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks agentic
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | fresh-study
keys: Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE STUDY CONTEXT | choose-baseline
keys: Up Up Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Labeled diagram Alpha | inspect-alpha
keys: b
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT CASES | explicit-baseline
ask: Is Alpha explicitly the baseline, with three repetitions and unchanged spending, while the incomplete one-case draft starts no work?
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE STUDY CONTEXT | choose-beta
keys: Up Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Labeled diagram Beta | inspect-beta
keys: +
require-live-snap: 20 2 cases | two-cases
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE STUDY CONTEXT | choose-gamma
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Labeled diagram Gamma | inspect-gamma
keys: +
require-live-snap: 20 3 cases | three-cases
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Matrix draft ready | fixed-matrix
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_result_evidence.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
ask: Does preparation freeze nine jobs and three exact contexts without model requests, global-context replacement or automatic approval?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | allowance-origin
resize: 40x12
wait: 0.3
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 Discovery passes | first-input-40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 Next action | last-input-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_result_evidence.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
keys: Home
resize: 120x36
wait: 0.3
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Enter
live-snap: total-call-editor
keys: 1 1 Enter
keys: Down Enter
keys: 2 Enter
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | approval
keys: End
require-live-snap: 15 y approve | approval-terms
expect: 9 fixed jobs
expect: Total provider calls: 11
expect: Protected review calls: 2
ask: Are the entire nine-job workload, one worker, exact model, eleven-call limit, protected review and uncertain dollars understandable before approval?
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Approval saved | approved-matrix
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 Plan approved | approved-jobs
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | launched
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_result_evidence.py @TMP_TARGET @ART finished
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 9 completed | completed
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 APPROVED STUDY | recovered-plan
keys: Home Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT CASES | saved-cases
keys: v
require-live-snap: 25 observed 3 / 3 | alpha-results
keys: Down
require-live-snap: 25 observed 2 / 3 | beta-results
keys: Down
require-live-snap: 25 observed 1 / 3 | gamma-results
keys: Up
live-snap: case-results
expect: baseline
expect: candidate
expect: Location:
ask: Do Alpha, Beta and Gamma retain separate recurrence denominators, completed work and unchanged decisions instead of inflating confidence across contexts?
keys: b
require-live-snap: 20 Choose | baseline-pass
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Baseline pass selected | explicit-baseline-pass
keys: Enter Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 Pass 3 | missed-candidate-pass
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 RUN DIFF | missing-observation-comparison
require-live-snap: 25 1 not observed | recorded-missing-observation
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 [Sources & context] | source-and-context
expect: Recorded content fingerprints match
expect-not: Unknown content cannot distinguish
ask: Does comparing the missing Beta observation keep source/context differences and raw history visible without claiming the finding was fixed?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Pass 3 | exact-comparison-origin
keys: Escape
resize: 160x48
wait: 0.3
live-snap: results-160x48
resize: 96x89
wait: 0.3
live-snap: results-96x89
resize: 80x24
wait: 0.3
live-snap: results-80x24
resize: 60x20
wait: 0.3
live-snap: results-60x20
resize: 40x12
wait: 0.3
live-snap: results-40x12
keys: Down
live-snap: last-case-40x12
keys: NPage
wait: 0.3
live-snap: evidence-40x12-page-1
keys: NPage
wait: 0.3
live-snap: evidence-40x12-page-2
keys: NPage
wait: 0.3
live-snap: evidence-40x12-page-3
keys: NPage
wait: 0.3
live-snap: evidence-40x12-page-4
keys: NPage
wait: 0.3
live-snap: evidence-40x12-page-5
keys: NPage
wait: 0.3
live-snap: evidence-40x12-page-6
keys: NPage
wait: 0.3
live-snap: evidence-40x12-page-7
keys: NPage
wait: 0.3
live-snap: evidence-40x12-page-8
keys: End
wait: 0.3
live-snap: evidence-end-40x12
keys: PPage
wait: 0.3
live-snap: evidence-back-40x12
keys: Home
keys: Enter Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 Pass 3 | last-pass-40x12
keys: Escape
resize: 120x36
wait: 0.3
keys: R
require-live-snap: 25 Context cases: 3 | matrix-report
expect: Evidence: 15 raw observations
expect: 9 committed / 11 calls
expect: Location:
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_result_evidence.py @TMP_TARGET @ART recap
resize: 160x48
wait: 0.3
live-snap: report-160x48
resize: 96x89
wait: 0.3
live-snap: report-96x89
resize: 80x24
wait: 0.3
live-snap: report-80x24
resize: 60x20
wait: 0.3
live-snap: report-60x20
resize: 40x12
wait: 0.3
live-snap: report-40x12
keys: End
wait: 0.3
live-snap: report-end-40x12
keys: PPage
wait: 0.3
live-snap: report-back-40x12
keys: Home
resize: 160x48
wait: 0.3
keys: p End
require-live-snap: 20 Observation receipt: | report-observation-receipts
expect: Fingerprint:
expect: Run:
ask: Do the recurrence recap's locations distinguish the same-title findings, with source and allowance above the cases and full observation receipts available in details?
keys: p Home
resize: 120x36
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 20 Context cases: 3 | report-recap-restored
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 25 format json (4/6) | selected-export
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | faithful-export
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_result_evidence.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT CASES | evidence-origin-restored
keys: Escape
ask: Can every case, pass and evidence page be read without skipped lines, with distinct same-title source observations, exact context and source receipts, export and unchanged verdicts?
resize: 120x36
wait: 0.3
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 9 completed | recovered-jobs
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 APPROVED STUDY | restarted-plan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_result_evidence.py @TMP_TARGET @ART hide-accounting
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 Accounting is unavailable | accounting-failure
expect: 9 committed / 11 total
ask: Does an unavailable ledger block continuation while retaining nine committed calls, protected review, cases and the same investigation?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_result_evidence.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restore-accounting
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 Matrix allowance refreshed | accounting-recovered
expect: 9 committed / 11 total
keys: Home Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Enter v
require-live-snap: 25 observed 3 / 3 | recovered-alpha-results
keys: Down
require-live-snap: 25 observed 2 / 3 | recovered-case-results
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_result_evidence.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart recover three cases, exact contexts, nine committed requests and protected review without another request or implicit model/context change?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
